        <mxCell id="3cTtt3uPs2pEaFsk9B-T-26" value="Add a red marker to the map frontend.&lt;div&gt;Upon clicking the marker, a popup menu should open displaying the uploaded image.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Marker and image visibility/accesibility: to everyone&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
