        <mxCell id="3cTtt3uPs2pEaFsk9B-T-28" value="Replace the orange marker with a yellow marker to the map frontend.&lt;div&gt;Now the popup menu should include the newly uploaded image too, as the array of two images.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
